ain' into worktrees/413-vibe-history-locator\n50d9098b368 chore(system-spec-kit): rebuild the trigger index\n0c5d5573471 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into worktrees/413-vibe-history-locator\n4cf725146c6 docs(changelog): say Vibe senders get the history lookup in v4.0.2.1\ndee2a67d196 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into worktrees/383-mistral-vibe-runtime\n058bdb27594 docs(changelog): rewrite the deep-loop changelogs in shorter sentences\n42fba2d360c test(cli-mistral-vibe): pass the five hardened checks live and close 004\n0bf6842fae4 feat(session-handover): offer the history lookup to Vibe senders at claim\n9db9e95fc77 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into worktrees/384-agent-alignment-follow-ups\n265e6a424ff fix(system-deep-loop): bill Mistral Vibe lineages to the Vibe budget\n58958cb3de7 docs(changelog): rewrite the CLI orchestration changelogs in shorter sentences\nd613b60c35f docs(changelog): rewrite the sk-code changelogs in shorter sentences\n59f6c0ed878 docs(changelog): rewrite the system-spec-kit changelogs in shorter sentences\nb1714b257a2 docs(changelog): rewrite the sk-doc changelogs in shorter sentences\n6f953d767e5 docs(changelog): rewrite the Skilled release line in shorter sentences\n614b1a1ea67 refactor(system-spec-kit): remove the unused nested changelog generator\ne673c77ba93 docs(sk-doc): add the changelog voice rule carve-out and the rewrite pilot\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false log --oneline ddb12a6852c..85550ee946e | cat\"}"},"time":{"start":1794815905785,"end":1794815906276}}}}
