{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794815914830,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"partID":"prt_1e35d706e001BSrLtA2mbxl6md","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e35d5c80001c3zb8UcDWh931d","type":"tool","id":"call_760052accf05491aaf03520b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git -c core.fsmonitor=false show --stat --format='%H%n%an%n%ad%n%n%B' 267c27fc5df | head -40; echo =====; git -c core.fsmonitor=false show --stat --format='%H%n%n%B' 0173020dfc2 | head -30"},"output":"267c27fc5df5f1313bdfc50c24819a9bd4a01df6\nMichel Kerkmeester\nMon Nov 16 07:54:07 2026 +0100\n\nfix(system-skill-advisor): keep suite records out of the shared metrics folder\n\nEach suite run now gets its own temp folder, so test health records stop landing where the health readers take them as real use. The transcript scorer also names the shape of every start and prints the split beside the start rate, so a reader can drop bare document reads without rescoring.\n\nCommit-Id: 0014490\n\n\n .../routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | 34 ++++++++++++++++----\n .../tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts       | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n .../system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts  | 13 ++++++++\n 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n=====\n0173020dfc2dfab9e7af24e6fa2b2c39e7a2023a\n\nfix(system-skill-advisor): let the arena builder read a whole repository listing\n\nThe builder's git helper now reads up to 512 MiB of output. The tracked dotenv scan lists every tracked file, about 20 MB in this repository, and overflowed the default buffer, so the builder refused every real checkout with spawn_failed.\n\nCommit-Id: 0014463\n\n\n .../routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs   |  8 ++++-\n .../tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts       | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n .../graph-metadata.json                            |  6 ++--\n .../scratch/after.txt                              |  8 ++---\n .../032-review-pass-five-remediation/tasks.md      |  3 +-\n 5 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"267c27fc5df5f1313bdfc50c24819a9bd4a01df6\nMichel Kerkmeester\nMon Nov 16 07:54:07 2026 +0100\n\nfix(system-skill-advisor): keep suite records out of the shared metrics folder\n\nEach suite run now gets its own temp folder, so test health records stop landing where the health readers take them as real use. The transcript scorer also names the shape of every start and prints the split beside the start rate, so a reader can drop bare document reads without rescoring.\n\nCommit-Id: 0014490\n\n\n .../routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | 34 ++++++++++++++++----\n .../tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts       | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n .../system-skill-advisor/runtime/vitest.config.ts  | 13 ++++++++\n 3 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)\n=====\n0173020dfc2dfab9e7af24e6fa2b2c39e7a2023a\n\nfix(system-skill-advisor): let the arena builder read a whole repository listing\n\nThe builder's git helper now reads up to 512 MiB of output. The tracked dotenv scan lists every tracked file, about 20 MB in this repository, and overflowed the default buffer, so the builder refused every real checkout with spawn_failed.\n\nCommit-Id: 0014463\n\n\n .../routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs   |  8 ++++-\n .../tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts       | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n .../graph-metadata.json                            |  6 ++--\n .../scratch/after.txt                              |  8 ++---\n .../032-review-pass-five-remediation/tasks.md      |  3 +-\n 5 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false show --stat --format='%H%n%an%n%ad%n%n%B' 267c27fc5df | head -40; echo =====;