{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816251082,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36293b10019mwmLiDTjeHWka","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e3627a5a001az5tbDEvp1K9XE","type":"tool","id":"call_161c98c74b5d41af87d2bcdd","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"sed -n '1,45p' .github/workflows/skill-advisor-stress.yml"},"output":"name: Skill Advisor Stress Tests\n\n# The advisor's stress suite only runs when SPECKIT_RUN_STRESS is set, and no\n# workflow set it, so two of its tests failed for months against code that had\n# moved on before anyone ran the suite. It takes about half a minute.\n#\n# The default suite ran nowhere either, and it carries the Python compatibility\n# suite (tests/compat/python-compat.vitest.ts spawns tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py).\n# It shares this job's install and build, so it adds only its own run time.\non:\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main, 'skilled/**']\n    paths:\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.opencode/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js'\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.github/workflows/skill-advisor-stress.yml'\n  push:\n    branches: [main, 'skilled/**']\n    paths:\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.opencode/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js'\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.github/workflows/skill-advisor-stress.yml'\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: ${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.event.pull_request.number || github.ref }}\n  cancel-in-progress: ${{ github.event_name == 'pull_request' }}\n\nenv:\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"name: Skill Advisor Stress Tests\n\n# The advisor's stress suite only runs when SPECKIT_RUN_STRESS is set, and no\n# workflow set it, so two of its tests failed for months against code that had\n# moved on before anyone ran the suite. It takes about half a minute.\n#\n# The default suite ran nowhere either, and it carries the Python compatibility\n# suite (tests/compat/python-compat.vitest.ts spawns tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py).\n# It shares this job's install and build, so it adds only its own run time.\non:\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main, 'skilled/**']\n    paths:\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.opencode/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/lib/launcher-*.cjs'\n      - '.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js'\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/tests/_support/**'\n      - '.github/workflows/skill-advisor-stress.yml'\n  push:\n    branches: [main, 'skilled/**']\n    paths:\n      - '.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/**'\n      - '.opencode/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs'\n      - '.openc