{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816777659,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36a96b3001Jsw5Jh4DVyAzRj","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e36a8a1a001RK1vaVVQwN9EdC","type":"tool","id":"call_784f69151c3e4136bb593edc","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).","oldString":"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\n- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -93,9 +93,8 @@\n \n - [Truncated git output read as complete]: `git()` raises `StepFailure` on `result.error`, so a buffer overflow can never reach `staleBuilds` or `trackedDotenvFiles` as a short list (iteration 1).\n - [A buffer cap that changes copy or symlink safety]: the cap bounds the bytes git prints; `copyPath`, `escapingLinks` and `stampBuildTree` are untouched by the diff (iteration 1).\n - [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\n-- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n - Dimension: traceability - Focus area: the spec, task and checklist claims behind both changes — phase 035's AC-001/AC-005, phase 032's T053 and T043 — and whether every suite entry point the packet claims is isolated actually is. - Reason: iteration 1's two advisories are both about the *scope* of a claim (a cleanup that covers one exit path, a variable that covers one platform family); the claims themselves live in the packet docs. - Rotation status: correctness complete for all three scope files; security, traceability and maintainability remain. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: productive — direct reproduction settled the buffer premise in one probe. - Required evidence: the two config files that define suite runs, the npm scripts that select them, and the workflow that runs each. - Recovery note: none; no failed iteration. Review verdict: PASS\n","status":"modified","additions":0,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\",\"oldString\":\"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\\n- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816775859,"end":1794816777659}}}}
