{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816934464,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36cf7e8002smR9TwjYYF455F","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e36ce999001BmXUlsOw2a5h49","type":"tool","id":"call_80353007472442df82bb32e3","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\n- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\n- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).","oldString":"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -116,8 +116,10 @@\n \n - [Truncated git output read as complete]: `git()` raises `StepFailure` on `result.error`, so a buffer overflow can never reach `staleBuilds` or `trackedDotenvFiles` as a short list (iteration 1).\n - [A buffer cap that changes copy or symlink safety]: the cap bounds the bytes git prints; `copyPath`, `escapingLinks` and `stampBuildTree` are untouched by the diff (iteration 1).\n - [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\n+- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\n+- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n - Dimension: maintainability - Focus area: the two remaining costs of the changes — a regression test whose premise is not asserted, and a buffer overflow that still reports as `spawn_failed` above the new cap. - Reason: correctness and traceability are covered; the two advisories left are about how cheaply the next reader can trust or diagnose these paths. - Rotation status: correctness and traceability complete; security and maintainability remain. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: productive — the checklist rows gave the fix's history without a live run. - Required evidence: the new test body, the `git()` failure shape, and the recorder's code. - Recovery note: none; no failed iteration. Review verdict: PASS\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\\n- [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\\n- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816931816,"end":1794816934464}}}}
