{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794817100603,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36f848b001P3DLFJOmXTDCJh","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e36f7787001miEkbLQK2Vcpz3","type":"tool","id":"call_ec93283497364091904e6312","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- [A private-mode regression in the per-run health folder]: `mkdtempSync` creates the folder mode `0700` (observed), and the writer still applies `0700`/`0600` inside it (iteration 3).\n- [A dotenv leak through the larger git read]: the cap bounds bytes printed; the copy filter is a separate walk the diff does not modify (iteration 3).","oldString":"- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -141,9 +141,10 @@\n - [Truncated git output read as complete]: `git()` raises `StepFailure` on `result.error`, so a buffer overflow can never reach `staleBuilds` or `trackedDotenvFiles` as a short list (iteration 1).\n - [A buffer cap that changes copy or symlink safety]: the cap bounds the bytes git prints; `copyPath`, `escapingLinks` and `stampBuildTree` are untouched by the diff (iteration 1).\n - [A per-run temp folder that breaks socket paths]: `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs` relocates a socket dir above the 104-byte `sun_path` limit, and the advisor's default socket dir is `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, not `tmpdir()` (iteration 1).\n - [A duplicate write into the shared metrics folder from the default suite]: `advisorHookOutcomesPath` resolves under `DURABLE_METRICS_ROOT`, which is computed from `tmpdir()` at import, and the config sets `TMPDIR` before any worker starts (iteration 2).\n-- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).\n+- [A private-mode regression in the per-run health folder]: `mkdtempSync` creates the folder mode `0700` (observed), and the writer still applies `0700`/`0600` inside it (iteration 3).\n+- [A dotenv leak through the larger git read]: the cap bounds bytes printed; the copy filter is a separate walk the diff does not modify (iteration 3).\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n - Dimension: none remaining. - Focus area: synthesis only. - Reason: `maxIterations=3` is reached with correctness, traceability, maintainability and a security read of the changed boundaries covered; no active P0 or P1. - Rotation status: complete. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: productive — the packet's own blocked-run note supplied the concrete input for the failure-code advisory. - Required evidence: the terminal convergence decision, the finding registry, and the synthesis report. - Recovery note: none; no failed iteration. Review verdict: PASS\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- [A private-mode regression in the per-run health folder]: `mkdtempSync` creates the folder mode `0700` (observed), and the writer still applies `0700`/`0600` inside it (iteration 3).\\n- [A dotenv leak through the larger git read]: the cap bounds bytes printed; the copy filter is a separate walk the diff does not modify (iteration 3).\",\"oldString\":\"- [An arena fix closed without an arena build]: T053's verify clause accepts a non-`spawn_failed` refusal, but T043 records the `ok:true` build at `0173020dfc2` with 22 copied trees, so the fix is proven (iteration 2).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/arena-config-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794817098891,"end":1794817100603}}}}
