{"type":"text","timestamp":1794817331982,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","part":{"id":"prt_1e372f69b002uBPmalW2g6e5jd","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84eaaffePZ4Vo82UrPH517","messageID":"msg_1e372e7a7001z240BJu2ZkY20n","type":"text","text":"BINDING: target=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\nBINDING: maxIterations=3\nBINDING: convergence=0.1\nBINDING: mode=review\nBINDING: dimensions=correctness,security,traceability,maintainability\nBINDING: specFolder=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\n\n## Review Lineage Complete — arena-config-6\n\n**Stop**: `maxIterationsReached` (3 of 3), newFindingsRatio 1.0 → 0.3333 → 0.4, reducer convergenceScore 0.6 against threshold 0.1 — the loop stopped at the ceiling, not on a claimed convergence.\n\n**Verdict**: PASS, `hasAdvisories: true` (registry-derived: 0 P0, 0 P1, 5 P2; 0 search debt, 0 failed gates).\n\n| Iter | Dimension | Findings |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | correctness | 2 P2 — exit-listener cleanup covers only a clean exit; the isolation sets `TMPDIR` alone, which `os.tmpdir()` ignores on Windows |\n| 2 | traceability | 1 P2 — the lever reaches `vitest.config.ts` but not `vitest.stress.config.ts`, the config CI runs the stress suite with, while the phase summary states it unconditionally |\n| 3 | maintainability (+ security read) | 2 P2 — the 6,000-file regression test never asserts its >1 MiB premise; an over-cap listing still reports as `spawn_failed`, the same string that blocked T043 |\n\n**Reproduced without touching repo tooling**: `git ls-files -z` on the fixture returns `ENOBUFS` at 1,114,112 bytes at the default cap and `status 0` with 1,116,018 bytes at 512 MiB (exactly T053's recorded size); a Node process with an `exit` listener writes nothing when sent `SIGTERM`; `mkdtempSync` yields mode `0700`. No suite run and no arena build — both write outside the lineage, and the builder refuses a destination inside a repository.\n\n**Integration evidence named**: `lib/metrics.ts:185`, `launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs:31/111-127`, `runtime/package.json:16-17`, `.github/workflows/skill-advisor-stress.yml:38/95/106`, the `.opencode` mirror of both configs and the builder, `035-suite-metrics-and-start-shape/{spec,acceptance-criteria,tasks,implementation-summary}.md`, `032-review-pass-five-remediation/tasks.md:116/164`.\n\n**Files written** (all inside the lineage): `deep-review-config.json`, `deep-review-strategy.md`, `deep-review-findings-registry.json` (reducer-owned, refreshed), `deep-review-state.jsonl` (gateway-only projection, 5 rows), `deep-review-dashboard.md`, `iterations/iteration-001..003.md`, `deltas/iter-001..003.jsonl`, `_events/{run-open,iter-001,iter-002,iter-003,closeout/synthesis_complete}.json`, `review-report.md`. Zero writes outside; `git status` shows only the dispatcher's pre-existing entries.\n\n**Honest limits**: `searchDebt` 0, one blocked class (`buffer_ceiling_reproduction`, unreachable — 512 MiB needs ~2.7M paths); the reducer's registry `dimension` field falls back to the first reviewed dimension, so the report states the true dimension per finding; AC_COVERAGE exempt (no root `acceptance-criteria.md`/`implementation-summary.md`).\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:arena-config-6","time":{"start":1794817324699,"end":1794817331982}}}
